msgid "页面包/整站包"
msgstr "Page Package / Site Package"

msgid "用于本地导入和导出启灵模块装修页、全局设计系统、内容模型、导航菜单和站点基础信息。系统保留页会自动拦截；包内页面互链、系统占位链接、URL 冲突策略、预检明细、临时预览和导入回滚都集中在这里处理。当前阶段不包含装修市场，也不连接远程模板分发。"
msgstr "Used to locally import and export Qiling module decoration page, global design system, content model, navigation menu and basic site information. System reserved pages will be automatically intercepted; interlinks between pages in the package, system placeholder links, URL conflict policies, preflight details, temporary previews and import rollbacks are all processed here. The current stage does not include the decoration market, nor is it connected to remote template distribution."

msgid "导入页面包/整站包"
msgstr "Import Page Package / Site Package"

msgid "可以上传 JSON 文件，也可以直接粘贴本地包内容。这里只处理启灵主题自己的模块装修页；导入会按“先预检 → 生成临时预览 → 执行导入”的流程进行，整站设置默认不会写入，必须在预检后手动勾选。"
msgstr "You can upload a JSON file or directly paste the local package content. Only Qiling Theme's own module decoration page is processed here; the import will be carried out according to the process of \"pre-check first → generate temporary preview → execute import\". The entire site settings will not be written by default and must be manually checked after pre-check."

msgid "上传 JSON 文件"
msgstr "Upload JSON File"

msgid "单个数据包最大 %s。"
msgstr "Maximum package size: %s."

msgid "或直接粘贴 JSON"
msgstr "Or paste JSON directly"

msgid "把页面包或整站包 JSON 粘贴到这里…"
msgstr "Paste the page package or site package JSON here..."

msgid "URL 冲突策略"
msgstr "URL Conflict Strategy"

msgid "预检数据包"
msgstr "Precheck Package"

msgid "预检会检查模板、模块、系统保留页、URL 冲突、站点设置和占位链接是否可解析。"
msgstr "Preflight checks whether templates, modules, system reserved pages, URL conflicts, site settings, and placeholder links are resolvable."

msgid "本地包能力说明"
msgstr "Local Package Capabilities"

msgid "当前支持"
msgstr "Currently Supported"

msgid "页面包支持启灵模块装修页；整站包可额外携带全局设计、内容模型、菜单、首页/文章页映射和站点标题。"
msgstr "The page package supports Qiling module decoration page; the whole site package can additionally carry global design, content model, menu, homepage/article page mapping and site title."

msgid "当前不支持"
msgstr "Currently Not Supported"

msgid "登录、注册、找回密码、个人中心等系统保留页会被拦截；第三方插件页面是否可迁移取决于插件自身能力。"
msgstr "System reserved pages such as login, registration, password retrieval, and personal center will be blocked; whether third-party plug-in pages can be migrated depends on the plug-in's own capabilities."

msgid "冲突策略"
msgstr "Conflict Strategy"

msgid "支持跳过、自动生成新 URL、仅更新同一数据包历史页面 3 种策略。"
msgstr "Supports 3 strategies: skip, automatically generate new URL, and only update the same packet history page."

msgid "占位链接"
msgstr "Placeholder Links"

msgid "支持 qiling://page/页面标识 和 qiling://system/login 这类引用；可解析的占位链接会自动转成真实链接，未解析项会保留原样并提示。"
msgstr "Supports references such as qiling://page/page identifier and qiling://system/login; resolvable placeholder links will be automatically converted into real links, and unresolved items will remain intact and prompted."

msgid "包信息"
msgstr "Package Info"

msgid "支持作者、描述、封面、分类、标签、依赖插件等元信息预览。"
msgstr "Supports preview of meta-information such as author, description, cover, category, tags, dependent plug-ins, etc."

msgid "本地导出"
msgstr "Local Export"

msgid "支持从当前主题页面中勾选多个装修页，导出页面包；也可选择整站包并附带全局配置清单。"
msgstr "It supports selecting multiple decoration pages from the current theme page and exporting the page package; you can also select the entire site package with a global configuration list."

msgid "明确不包含"
msgstr "Explicitly Not Included"

msgid "不包含装修市场、远程上架、购买、在线分发或第三方模板源。"
msgstr "Does not include the decoration market, remote listing, purchase, online distribution or third-party template sources."

msgid "系统保留页"
msgstr "System Reserved Pages"

msgid "页面用途"
msgstr "Page Purpose"

msgid "保留 URL"
msgstr "Reserved URL"

msgid "保留模板"
msgstr "Reserved Template"

msgid "导出页面包/整站包"
msgstr "Export Page Package / Site Package"

msgid "这里只导出启灵主题自己的模块装修页。系统页和没有模块数据的普通页面不会出现在导出列表里；选择整站包时，可以额外写入设计系统、内容模型、菜单和站点基础信息。"
msgstr "Only the Qiling theme's own module decoration page is exported here. System pages and ordinary pages without module data will not appear in the export list; when selecting the entire site package, you can additionally write the design system, content model, menu and site basic information."

