msgstr "Common address examples of Alibaba Bailian compatible with OpenAI Chat Completions: <code>https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1</code>. Just fill in the basic address, and the topic will automatically complete <code>/chat/completions</code>."

