msgstr "This only adds basic configuration entries. All features are disabled by default. When disabled, they do not change the existing Chinese site, Baidu analytics, Alibaba Cloud captcha, filing info, language switcher, or SEO output."

msgid "第三方代码管理、Cookie 控制、国际排版增强、SEO 基础检查、上线检查清单和配置快照已完成基础接入；所有能力默认按各自开关控制。"
msgstr "Third-party code management, Cookie control, international typography enhancement, SEO basics check, launch checklist, and configuration snapshot have been wired in at the basic level. Each feature is controlled by its own switch."

msgid "上线前检查"
