msgid "只读汇总当前国际化基础配置，帮助确认是否会输出新代码、是否需要 Cookie 同意、是否存在多语言 SEO 复核项。"
msgstr "Read-only summary of the current internationalization basics, helping confirm whether new code will output, whether Cookie consent is required, and whether multilingual SEO needs review."

msgid "配置快照"
