msgid "只读生成一份脱敏交付摘要，便于上线前复制给运营、开发或 AI 排查。不会保存新字段，也不会包含第三方代码正文。"
msgstr "Generate a read-only sanitized delivery summary for operations, developers, or AI troubleshooting. It does not save new fields and does not include third-party code content."

msgid "第三方代码"
msgstr "Third-party Code"

msgid "用于统一粘贴海外统计、广告转化、客服和追踪脚本。只影响本页新增字段，不接管原有百度统计或自定义 JS。"
msgstr "Paste overseas analytics, ad conversion, customer service, and tracking scripts in one place. This only affects the new fields on this page and does not take over existing Baidu analytics or custom JS."

msgid "启用第三方代码管理"
msgstr "Enable Third-party Code Management"

msgid "默认关闭。开启后才会输出下面已启用的代码组。"
msgstr "Disabled by default. When enabled, only the enabled code groups below will be output."

msgid "提示：Google Analytics、GTM、Google Ads、Meta Pixel、TikTok Pixel 等直接把对应平台提供的代码粘贴到下方即可。验证码、支付、短信、邮件服务商不在本阶段范围内。"
msgstr "Tip: Paste the code provided by Google Analytics, GTM, Google Ads, Meta Pixel, TikTok Pixel, and similar platforms below. Captcha, payment, SMS, and email providers are outside this phase."

msgid "头部代码"
